+[PASS] Executor local heartbeat changed to 30 seconds.
+[PASS] Executor stale grace changed to 90 seconds.
+[PASS] Executor presence is deduplicated before WebSocket send.
+[PASS] HTTP fallback backoff = 3s -> 5s -> 10s -> 30s.
+[PASS] Dashboard and Side Panel safety license poll = 60 seconds.
+[PASS] Local expiresAt countdown triggers expiry lock without waiting for server poll.
+[PASS] Background Remote license safety alarm = 60 seconds.
+[PASS] Background local exact expiry alarm added.
+[PASS] Worker license_event is handled by Desktop background.
+
+Backend checks
+[PASS] Source based on Cloudflare Device API REV332 so later Token Gate / Remote features are retained.
+[PASS] Existing Hibernation API acceptWebSocket retained.
