+[PASS] Expired socket receives LICENSE_EXPIRED event then closes.
+[PASS] No new Durable Object class or migration required.
+
+Runtime limitations
+- Physical browser/mobile end-to-end test was not performed here.
+- Manual admin Block/Delete is caught by the 60-second safety validation unless a separate Admin push event is implemented.
+- Android APK binary is not rebuilt in this package because the production signing private key is not present. Source patch is included for rebuild using the existing signing chain.
