@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+TF Analyzer Analyst — REV368
+Version: v1.16.82
+
+FOCUS
+- Strict TradersFamily login preflight before Update.
+- Update no longer trusts already-open/cached TradersFamily tabs as proof of login.
+- A fresh no-cache request to the protected account area is authoritative.
+- If the real server session is logged out, Update is blocked, cached login/profile state is cleared, the sidebar returns to Login, and open TradersFamily tabs are reloaded with bypassCache.
+- If login cannot be verified because the network is unavailable/unknown, Update is blocked instead of starting a scan that will fail.
+- STOP remains immediately available while an Update is already running.
+- Remote Mobile Update now waits for the same preflight and returns TRADERSFAMILY_LOGIN_REQUIRED when the PC session is logged out.
+
+RETAINED
+- REV367 low-usage realtime Remote: 30s WebSocket heartbeat, 60s license safety check, exact expiry enforcement, exponential HTTP recovery.
+- REV366 hover-free Table 2 and centered Refresh icon.
+- REV365 dashboard scroll optimization.
+- REV364 APK-style percentage Equity axis.
+- REV363 manual activation once per newly loaded plugin build.
+- Device Lock, scanner, calculations, Import/Export, iSignal, Remote and table behavior retained.
